* ''0.6.0'' -- 2026.09.28 -- Hello! Puts the fields of [[PKM Schema|https://github.com/nikorion/TW-PKM-Schema]] (required) in the tiddler editor, each control drawn from the field's definition (`kind`): dropdown, radio buttons, checkboxes, free value or list with suggestions, date picker — a field added to the schema gets its control with nothing to change here. Rows and radio controls are configurable (`$:/config/nikorion/pkm-fields/row/…`, `…/control/…`). A field shows where it applies; one that does not apply yet holds a value is framed in red, its reason as tooltip. Labels give the field's description as tooltip, values their hint and stored value. A tiddler's `icon` follows its role. With [[Dynamic Table|https://github.com/nikorion/TW-Dynamic-Table]] installed, the same fields get their table columns: cells edited with the editor's controls, header labels and tooltips, and row colour from the values' tones.
